WEBVTT

1
00:00:02.780 --> 00:00:05.950
NARRATOR: The caseworker moves
on to Desiree's transition

2
00:00:06.000 --> 00:00:08.880
paperwork and does not ask about Jay.

3
00:00:08.980 --> 00:00:12.760
DESIREE: Okay.
Yeah, I can do the ID stuff.

4
00:00:12.900 --> 00:00:15.500
I think I still have my
birth certificate somewhere.

5
00:00:15.640 --> 00:00:17.840
School's fine. I'm passing.

6
00:00:18.500 --> 00:00:22.020
(sighs) Honestly, this is the
easiest meeting we've ever had.

7
00:00:22.460 --> 00:00:25.340
Everybody else always wants
to talk about my feelings.

8
00:00:26.140 --> 00:00:28.800
Oh, and I don't need
the job-training thing.

9
00:00:29.240 --> 00:00:31.340
Jay says I won't even need a regular job.

10
00:00:31.640 --> 00:00:33.800
His friend has something lined up for me.

11
00:00:34.040 --> 00:00:36.440
I'm just supposed to keep
it quiet until I'm out.

12
00:00:36.840 --> 00:00:38.680
NARRATOR: The meeting went smoothly.

13
00:00:39.040 --> 00:00:43.020
What did Desiree tell you,
and what did you not ask?
